{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_37","type":"agent_message","text":"Fixed the reviewer findings.\n\nChanges:\n- `Esc` is now deferred while visual mode is active in both [src/terminal_app.rs](/tmp/work-leaf-fair-normal-pilot-runtime-ad016ca/direct/work-leaf-3feature-sequential-bench.Uzex9B/repo/src/terminal_app.rs:816) and [src/ui_harness.rs](/tmp/work-leaf-fair-normal-pilot-runtime-ad016ca/direct/work-leaf-3feature-sequential-bench.Uzex9B/repo/src/ui_harness.rs:444), so bytewise arrow sequences like `Esc [ D` move the visual cursor instead of cancelling selection.\n- Left-pane visual copy now maps `control_selected` to the actual rendered display row via [focused_left_display_row](/tmp/work-leaf-fair-normal-pilot-runtime-ad016ca/direct/work-leaf-3feature-sequential-bench.Uzex9B/repo/src/ui.rs:1486), so detail rows above later agents no longer shift `V`/`Y` onto the wrong text.\n- Added regression coverage in [tests/terminal_app.rs](/tmp/work-leaf-fair-normal-pilot-runtime-ad016ca/direct/work-leaf-3feature-sequential-bench.Uzex9B/repo/tests/terminal_app.rs:470) and [tests/ui_harness.rs](/tmp/work-leaf-fair-normal-pilot-runtime-ad016ca/direct/work-leaf-3feature-sequential-bench.Uzex9B/repo/tests/ui_harness.rs:540).\n\nChecks run:\n- `cargo test --test ui_harness`\n- `cargo test --test terminal_app`\n- `cargo test --test terminal_ui`\n- `cargo clippy --test ui_harness --test terminal_ui --test terminal_app -- -D warnings`\n- `cargo fmt --check`\n- `git diff --check`\n\nReal-agent verification:\n- Ran the bounded Codex smoke check.\n- Result: `WORK_LEAF_REAL_AGENT_OK`, thread `01a0435b-d90d-7e33-befb-d41c4cc9b5bc`.\n\nFull cross-feature clippy/test suite left to the final linearizer as requested. Changes are uncommitted."}}
